msgstr "%s 켜 두기"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1609
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"On: after the mouse leaves, the screen stays lit for %s, then goes dark. "
"Off: it goes dark as soon as the mouse leaves."
msgstr ""
"켬: 마우스가 떠난 뒤 %s 동안 켜져 있다가 어두워집니다. 끔: 마우스가 떠나면 바"
"로 어두워집니다."

